<title>UK: Dresdner sets warrants on Roche Holding.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets warrants on Roche Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG, Frankfurt has issued two million American-style call warrants, on the certificates of participation of Roche Holding AG, lead manager Banque Internationale de Placement, Paris said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    13,500 CHF		PREMIUM	13.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.05 CHF		  GEARING	11.7 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.JUN.97-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	03.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  13,120 CHF		RATIO	  200/1</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
